      <h1 class="jr-h1">Collagen Tablets vs Capsules vs Liquid Shots: An Honest Comparison</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">
        Every form of collagen on the Indian market claims the same benefits, but they do not
        deliver the same dose. An orthopaedic surgeon does the arithmetic on tablets, capsules,
        sachets, gummies and shots, including the part where our own format costs you more.
      </p>

